{"id": 90, "name": "Silvanna", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1582f0613b6c03e1f4f147a3da23d70a.png", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Initiator", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["50", "40", "70", "20"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Princess of the Moniyan Empire and queen regent.", "skills": [{"name": "Knightess' Resolve", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8a659e353c870bc077564afaaf4d8c2c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Silvanna's Basic Attacks deal 25<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+75% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\nSilvanna's attacks apply a mark on enemy heroes for 5s on hit, each mark reducing their Physical & Magic Defense by 3-6 (up to 5 stacks).\nSilvanna's skills and Basic Attacks deal 30% extra damage to enemy heroes with the max number of marks."}, {"name": "Cometic Lance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dbeca4aa319bdc1e24af7f53f6e6f8b9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Silvanna dashes forward. Upon reaching the max range or hitting a non-Minion enemy, she swings her lance, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies and stunning them for 1s."}, {"name": "Spiral Strangling", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e72b0d82cfd40062ad9bb1485232b91f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   M